{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "995f04c095c6b415713d0bf437c1bdb34438571688d4be63d76d0a0537285783", "ja": "グルメ番組のお仕事", "zh": "美食节目工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4000_place", "source_sha256": "3d44ee6c2347f1b74d7e4433ec4f514493709abf46436b561e0c953429446f25", "ja": "収録スタジオ袖", "zh": "摄影棚侧边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4001_p", "source_sha256": "5ae6901a89f74dd051b4f2d01242312bd68c01a694588203989af4fd44b35150", "ja": "（グルメ番組の本番まで、あと2時間。\nのり子の様子を確認しておくか……）", "zh": "（距离美食节目正式开始还有两个小时，\n先去确认法子的状况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4002_043nor", "source_sha256": "81b2674f328fcedb599d2910e5fde5ae3f07284767be6c36e4a1179726af4507", "ja": "ううー……、{$P$}……。\n助……けて……。アタシ……もう、限界……。", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}……\n救……救命……我……已经、到极限了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4003_p", "source_sha256": "3185b77be3251687e7318632cd48444fcc19ffd70ec79cadbb17cab9f424d60c", "ja": "の、のり子！？\nいったいどうしたんだ！", "zh": "法、法子！？\n你到底是怎么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4004_043nor", "source_sha256": "b7d6d8cb66bb56474dc5dac9540502fef4495069f9db55a9dbe004d0b059d700", "ja": "実は……昨日から、何も食べてなくって……。", "zh": "其实……我从昨天开始就什么都没吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4005_p", "source_sha256": "e6f062b7ac4f0b06ff6ef9b246a5dc49e074c75179445c030c2ea4086002862d", "ja": "昨日から！？　\nどうして、そんなことを……。", "zh": "从昨天开始！？\n为什么要做这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4006_043nor", "source_sha256": "391b3b2208ed592a8cf6d887a0015a9b97f85b294d9d72def6234fa2d5e85136", "ja": "今日のために、お腹を減らしといた方がいいと思った\nんだよ～。まさか空腹が、こんなにツラいとは……。", "zh": "我想说，为了今天，先空着肚子比较好啊～\n没想到空腹竟然会这么难受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4007_043nor", "source_sha256": "10fee7ef51c252a6013f6b0be103c743985388282aa38d39c7ce502bdecd4d20", "ja": "もうダメ……アタシ、本番まで耐えられない！\n{$P$}、何か食べてきてもいい？", "zh": "不行了……我忍不到正式录影了！\n{$P$}，我可以吃点东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4008", "source_sha256": "c96592439f2ec150c10a800f8f91266ea0074066df18fb718ffa87cb2c52e540", "ja": "好きなだけ食べろ", "zh": "尽量吃吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4009", "source_sha256": "980e25a866ee64eca840c5e0836ceda2231210aba9bba73388729071ce1ba148", "ja": "少しだけなら…", "zh": "可以吃一点点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4010", "source_sha256": "c114928d7fd583870958436cb24cd302579fb3ab3e18ffc211163acaf9ab6974", "ja": "本番までガマンだ！", "zh": "要忍到正式录影！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4100_p", "source_sha256": "3d0a337c3e5123c27a315cb5c4815de5a8d17f5bf41fc10ba84c55b1db67039b", "ja": "まったくもう……好きなだけ食べてきていいぞ。\nそんな調子で、本番に差し支える方が大変だし。", "zh": "真是的……你就尽量吃吧。\n像这样影响到正式录影，反而比较严重。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4101_043nor", "source_sha256": "14cd51db12c626da42fd5e30a9caae4693962c5a6a6bad7a9f8b9c9b03a6fd68", "ja": "ホント！？　やったぁ、コンビニ行ってこよっと！\n待ってて、アタシの焼肉弁当……！", "zh": "真的！？太好了，那我去趟便利商店啰！\n我的烧肉便当，等等我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4102_p", "source_sha256": "5058555545aa489eff557e492c76a67c3376510f1c4045d1ffd83d20f91311ce", "ja": "こ、こら、のり子！\nあくまで、本番に響かない程度にだからな……！", "zh": "喂、喂，法子！\n至少要在不影响正式录影的范围啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4103_043nor", "source_sha256": "d933ea4738ba07fab8952b70160c8a0bf807cb70333dfec585e7bbcb99995495", "ja": "も～わかってるってば～♪\n大丈夫、そんなにたくさん食べないから！", "zh": "哎唷～我知道啦～♪\n别担心，我不会吃那么多的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4104_043nor", "source_sha256": "b8abaf77ef40fa471eeba834e7e2680e12e8bb1ee2bcb2e735610af3ab9f2bdb", "ja": "「好きなだけ食べていい」なんてさ、信用されてるって\n証拠だもんね。へへ♪　じゃ、ちょっと行ってくる！", "zh": "毕竟你说「尽量吃」，这就是信任我的证据呢。\n嘿嘿♪那我马上就回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4200_p", "source_sha256": "1d524a44a6a783d7b94f6e5d0b3e0502437d10f26e2d2375e992f4017f5a94ac", "ja": "仕方ないな。少しだけならいいけど……\n本番に差し支えないようにしなきゃダメだぞ？　ほら。", "zh": "真拿你没办法，吃一点点倒是可以……\n可不能影响到正式录影喔？给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4201_043nor", "source_sha256": "4d4b92db0c8562d451d334836cedea0b499b3e80af310242d8be59904d2776de", "ja": "やった！　ありがと、{$P$}……\nって、ええっ！？　このお菓子だけぇ！？", "zh": "太好了！谢谢你，{$P$}……\n咦咦！？只有这包点心！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4202_043nor", "source_sha256": "a9614d0aba1ff90e767df96249c0fb31a40c5ad6c9a1fbcfaf99e8b42923976e", "ja": "ホントに少しだし、お菓子なんてお腹にたまんないよ！\nはぁ……次から無理すんのはやめとこ……。", "zh": "还真的只有一点点，而且点心也填不饱肚子呀！\n唉……下次还是别勉强自己了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4300_p", "source_sha256": "47ef20c4e08f56894bb6387731416e4655298b2388b8835aeac4cde229c41eaf", "ja": "ダメだ。本番まで、もう2時間しかないんだぞ？\nそれまでガマンすること。", "zh": "不行，距离录影只剩两小时了喔？\n要忍到那个时候才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4301_043nor", "source_sha256": "a77581f2bb9ffca26a977acae7cc4c230c1a0b9009b9dfb6f9830c50153c1bc8", "ja": "ええーっ！？　アタシがこんなに苦しんでるのに！？\n{$P$}の鬼ー！", "zh": "咦咦──！？我都这么痛苦了耶！？\n{$P$}你这魔鬼──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_043nor_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_043nor_4302_043nor", "source_sha256": "4af955393c9a0bc107c24f8e62d36bcc76f1354bd758348dce90145bea100c87", "ja": "うう……。本番、まだかなぁ……。\n焼肉……唐揚げ……。牛カルビぃ～……！", "zh": "呜呜……正式录影还不开始吗……\n烧肉……炸鸡…………牛五花～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
